      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but honestly i'm a bit worried about the score. the automated system is pretty strict and it's flagging this because it's only 5 points. i know i said don't make it fluff, but if the score is too low the leads might think we didn't actually do much in the meeting. \n\ncan you try to expand the list a bit? maybe break out those main points into more specific, actionable sub-tasks so the score is higher, but just... try to keep them somewhat professional so the devs don't get annoyed. just make it more detailed?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
